ience and you don't have the same  options as if you were visiting their  island in real time but it's still a  great way to check out a friend's island  and maybe get some design inspiration  now quick important note here to visit a  friend's island or have a friend  visit you it does require a nintendo  online account which is a paid account  at this point  so in order to be able to experience  that you would have to be a nintendo  online member  and at number four we have design ideas  so many design ideas guys because  of the fact that the game has been out  for nearly a full calendar year there  are plenty of places to look for tips  advice and inspiration like hopefully  this channel there are a number of  fantastic youtube channels subreddits  and discords dedicated to animal  crossing design ideas  in my opinion this is where animal  crossing shines the brightest i am  constantly amazed by this community and  their level of creativity when it comes  to custom designs home layouts island  layouts and decorations  thanks to the addition of terraforming  and new horizons you can truly shape  your island as you see fit  to be honest designing special areas of  my island around different themes has  been one of my favorite things to do in  new horizons  i got the game back at launch and still  haven't even put much time into  decorating my house because i've spent  so much time and energy worried about  the overall design of my island instead  if you care more about your home though  that's also an enjoyable endeavor with  plenty of design  inspiration available online number five  on our list we have  longevity you see animal crossing as a  series has always had this special sense  of timelessness to it  there are plenty of people out there  even today who still check in on their  old gamecube islands or with animal  crossing wild world or new leaf  some people check all three of them if  the game clicks with you in the right  way then it could be one of those g